{"seq":30,"slug":"green-hydrogen","title":"绿色氢能","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen","rating":{"composite":3.91,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"绿色氢能经济学\">绿色氢能经济学</h1><p>氢能正在从实验室走向万亿级产业。2026 年全球绿氢产能突破百万吨量级，中国建成投运超 25 万吨/年可再生能源制氢产能，欧盟在 REPowerEU 框架下推动&quot;双千万吨&quot;目标，美国以 IRA 45V 补贴将绿氢成本压至 1 美元/公斤以下。当电解槽订单以年增 200% 的速度爆发、当碳边境调节机制（CBAM）让灰氢出口企业面临成本悬崖时，理解绿色氢能的技术经济逻辑已不再是能源从业者的专属课题，而是所有关注产业转型与资本配置的学习者必须掌握的知识框架。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦绿色氢能的<strong>经济学视角</strong>——从制氢成本结构、技术路线比较、市场供需格局到投融资决策链条。与兄弟 hub 的分工边界如下：环境与气候经济学 hub 侧重碳定价机制与绿色金融的宏观理论框架，本 hub 则深入氢能这一具体赛道的微观经济分析；金融风险管理 hub 处理通用的风险计量与压力测试方法论，本 hub 则将这些方法应用于绿氢项目的特定风险场景（技术风险、政策风险、承购协议风险）。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径因读者背景而异。对于能源与金融交叉背景的读者，建议按章节顺序从基础概念、技术路线、市场格局到投资决策依次推进。对于已有电化学或能源工程知识的读者，可跳过第一章基础部分，直接从第二章技术经济性比较切入。对于金融或投资背景的读者，建议先读第一章建立技术直觉，再跳至第四章投融资专题，需要时回溯第二、三章补充技术与市场细节。</p>\n<p>前置知识要求较低：需要理解基本的财务指标概念（NPV、IRR、LCOE），了解可再生能源发电的基本原理（光伏/风电的间歇性特征），以及对全球气候治理框架（巴黎协定、碳市场）有初步认知。不要求化学或电化学专业背景——本 hub 会从第一性原理解释电解水的核心机制。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础概念与经济框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hydrogen-colors-and-green-hydrogen","title":"氢能色谱与绿色氢能定义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/foundations/hydrogen-colors-and-green-hydrogen"},{"seq":2,"slug":"water-electrolysis-principles","title":"水电解制氢原理与能效边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/foundations/water-electrolysis-principles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lcoh-economics","title":"平准化制氢成本（LCOH）经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/foundations/lcoh-economics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"technology","title":"电解技术路线与经济性比较","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"alkaline-electrolysis","title":"碱性电解（ALK）技术经济性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/technology/alkaline-electrolysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pem-electrolysis","title":"质子交换膜（PEM）电解技术经济性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/technology/pem-electrolysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"soec-and-emerging","title":"固体氧化物电解池（SOEC）与新兴技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/technology/soec-and-emerging"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"markets","title":"市场格局与政策驱动","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/markets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"global-hydrogen-demand","title":"全球氢能需求结构与应用场景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/markets/global-hydrogen-demand"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hydrogen-trade-infrastructure","title":"氢能贸易与基础设施经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/markets/hydrogen-trade-infrastructure"},{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-and-regulation","title":"氢能政策与监管框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/markets/policy-and-regulation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"investment","title":"投融资决策与成本路径","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/investment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"project-financing","title":"绿氢项目融资与商业模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/investment/project-financing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-assessment","title":"绿氢投资风险评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/investment/risk-assessment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-reduction-roadmap","title":"绿氢成本下降路径与投资前景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/green-hydrogen/investment/cost-reduction-roadmap"}]}]}